  "is_folder": false,
  "content": {
    "_uid": "ef56668d-7b78-6677-ba65-ee925a961c50",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "e2ddb666-48a4-4ecf-3064-9b0f4c9af1a7",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "A broad range of activities and materials were used to improve the participants' English skills. These courses followed a blended approach and included face-to-face classes and online learning tasks.",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                },
                {
                  "text": "The students actively participated in these course and found them relevant and useful to their English language needs. By the end of the four-week period, the students reported that they felt very confident and it was worth the time spent on the summer courses. ",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                },
                {
                  "text": "ELE_net is very pleased with the success of these courses and looks forward to offering more courses for students this winter.",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
